sequenceDiagram
    actor Author
    participant YAML as scenario YAML
    participant CLI as eatme CLI
    participant Assets as eatme-assets validation
    participant Gadugi as gadugi generator
    participant CI as CI gate

    Author->>YAML: edit assets/scenarios/eatme/*.yaml
    Author->>CLI: assets validate --json
    CLI->>Assets: validate_scenario_asset / validate_assets
    Assets-->>CLI: validation report
    Author->>CLI: assets generate-gadugi --check --json
    CLI->>Gadugi: generate_gadugi_adapters(root, check)
    Gadugi-->>CLI: adapter generation report
    CI->>CLI: rerun validate + gadugi freshness checks
    CLI-->>CI: pass or fail merge gate
